{"id":"56f4ef08abc6d228","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-hierarchy-incompleteness.md","title":"Hierarchy Incompleteness","display":"prop-hierarchy-incompleteness — Hierarchy Incompleteness","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-hierarchy-incompleteness","aliases":["92-prop-hierarchy-incompleteness"],"display":"prop-hierarchy-incompleteness — Hierarchy Incompleteness","depends_on":["[[92-thm-sigma1-completeness]]","[[92-thm-pi1-incompleteness]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]","[[92-df-standard-model]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-delta0-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-hierarchy-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-hierarchy-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-hierarchy-incompleteness — Hierarchy Incompleteness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5f2ffbfa1e13e5e2\" href=\"?note=5f2ffbfa1e13e5e2\" title=\"92-thm-sigma1-completeness\">92-thm-sigma1-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"235651614fd28cce\" href=\"?note=235651614fd28cce\" title=\"92-thm-pi1-incompleteness\">92-thm-pi1-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7ce1b12990ae9469\" href=\"?note=7ce1b12990ae9469\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"d754a154b50a9533\" href=\"?note=d754a154b50a9533\" title=\"92-df-delta0-formula\">92-df-delta0-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (external consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G,\\Pi_1^G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G,\\Pi_1^G\\)</span> (arithmetical hierarchy classes)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span> (standard arithmetic structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (effectivity and arithmetic-strength conditions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\\)</span> (bounded internal proof formula used by the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> witness construction)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\sigma\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\sigma)\n\\land\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\Pi_1^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\pi\\land G\\nvdash\\pi)\n\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\sigma\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\sigma)\n\\land\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\Pi_1^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\pi\\land G\\nvdash\\pi)\n\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>完备，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>不完备</li>\n<li>这是不完备性的层级视角</li>\n<li>解释：\n<ul>\n<li>真<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>句由有限见证与含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>的基本算术验证而可证</li>\n<li>真且不可证的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>见证来自复杂度保持的Gödel构造或内部一致性句，并使用相容性与标准证明算术化</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>不能仅由“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span>真且<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\pi\">\\(\\neg\\pi\\)</span>是假<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>句”推出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\nvdash\\neg\\pi\">\\(G\\nvdash\\neg\\pi\\)</span>；那一步需要<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>一致性。此处只断言<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\nvdash\\pi\">\\(G\\nvdash\\pi\\)</span></li>\n<li>规范Gödel句和内部一致性句可取为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>，但任意在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中与它们可证等价的公式未必具有相同字面层级</li>\n<li>一个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>句只有在标准模型中为真时才由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>完备性推出可证</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-thm-sigma1-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"5f2ffbfa1e13e5e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-sigma1-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-pi1-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"235651614fd28cce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-pi1-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depen